        },
        "publishTime": "2026-05-13T05:52:33.468663676Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGMExWUmtSVVptVkd0SVdXMUNjVFYyU3psWlIyYxAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGMExWUmtSVVptVkd0SVdXMUNjVFYyU3psWlIyYxAB!2m1!1s0x3403ffe73cfaf78d:0x40c3cd57d957436b"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJjff6POf_AzQRa0NX2VfNw0A/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xoM2NrNXNMV1J4VFMxV2VscGpURE4yY1VsUmNtYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "一家本地寶藏小店。物超所值，餐飲選擇豐富，老闆熱情好客。我們享用了2小時暢飲套餐，也嘗試了印度菜——說實話，這絕對是我在香港吃過最好吃的咖哩之一。酒水套餐的性價比也無可挑剔——絕對值得一去，我們還會再來的。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "A local gem. Great value food and drink with a gracious host. We enjoyed the 2 hour free flow and tried the Indian food- was honestly one of the best curries I have had in Hong Kong. Cant argue with the value of the drinks package- definitely worth stopping by and we will be returning.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Lee Parker",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105147207714726478565/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUL22KOmUkxhH0VbKxzH6qcR3aKgKLeNXsHwLdmNllVEheLaEVn=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo"
        },
        "publishTime": "2026-07-21T02:55:12.029636319Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xoM2NrNXNMV1J4VFMxV2VscGpURE4yY1VsUmNtYxAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xoM2NrNXNMV1J4VFMxV2VscGpURE4yY1VsUmNtYxAB!2m1!1s0x3403ffe73cfaf78d:0x40c3cd57d957436b"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJjff6POf_AzQRa0NX2VfNw0A/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCU2NHMW5hakJZWDBSbmRtOWZSMVZXWkRsaFdYYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "1 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "食物真的太棒了——奶油雞、咖哩雞塊，簡直絕了！我和妻子非常享受這個夜晚，也和老闆聊得很開心。強烈推薦！",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Absolutely loved the food - butter chicken, chicken tikka masala absolute beast! My wife and i really enjoyed the evening and the conversation with the boss. Highly recommended",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Bruno Cheung",
