      {
        "name": "places/ChIJjff6POf_AzQRa0NX2VfNw0A/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Kbk5WaElVSHAzY0ZsMFQzUkRhWGRoVEVwUFlWRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "1 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "整體評價非常明確，食物和服務都非常棒，我會帶家人和朋友再來這家餐廳😊😁",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Shares a clear overall opinion describes the food and service are very Amazing and I would to come back to this restaurant with my family and friends 😊😁",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Asmita Kumari",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117831876579875668735/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKoStVbZpUpyork5Py49fJpH5MzlpvzZE09YJeUul0iTM7fUw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo"
        },
        "publishTime": "2026-08-31T04:16:19.342298557Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Kbk5WaElVSHAzY0ZsMFQzUkRhWGRoVEVwUFlWRRAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Kbk5WaElVSHAzY0ZsMFQzUkRhWGRoVEVwUFlWRRAB!2m1!1s0x3403ffe73cfaf78d:0x40c3cd57d957436b"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJjff6POf_AzQRa0NX2VfNw0A/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21SS0xUTklORWQ2TUhBMVUxQXpUM0IyUTBaTU1HYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "7 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "我超愛這家餐廳的夜晚氛圍，歌手們唱的歌我都喜歡😍😍😍😍。食物更絕了，是我吃過最好吃的印度菜之一。我點了薩莫薩三角餃，四個才58港幣，在香港簡直是高麗菜價！味道超棒，還有那個叫酸辣醬的綠色醬汁，薄荷味十足，美味極了。我還點了印度脆球，也很好吃。不過我最愛的還是羊肉羅根喬什，簡直太美味了！ ！這家店是赤柱的Surf and Turf推薦的。如果你喜歡印度菜，一定要來試試！",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "I love the atmosphere in the night the singers were playing the songs and they even played the songs I loved😍😍😍😍. The food was something else it was one of the best Indian food I ever had, I had the samosas it was 4 pcs and it was only $58 which is a steal in Hong Kong it was so tasty and the green sauce that is called chutney it was so minty and delicious and I also had the pani puri was also very good but my favourite was lamb roganjosh only one word, DELICIOUS!!. Well I got this place recommended by surf and turf in Stanley. This is a much try if you like Indian food!!!!",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Sarojani Negi",
